# This is a catalogue, not a compiler project: what lives here is the addon
# bundles (text) and registry.json. Two things must never be committed.

# 1. Build output. scripts/pack-addon.ps1 writes the release zips here; the
#    published artifact is the release asset, never a file in the tree.
dist/

# 2. Binaries. An mcp/tool addon may SHIP a compiled artifact, but it is bundled
#    at pack time from outside the repo (-Binaries) - a catalogue that carried
#    exes would be unreviewable, and every clone would pay for them forever.
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.zip

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
